{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:23:303","content":{"id":303,"title":"持续不断","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"持续记录的重要性，知识需要时间的累积才能看到效果，不可能一口气吃成一个大胖子。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"换了很多的笔记软件，尝试了很多的笔记方法，都没有办法坚持不断的进行记录，原因在于没有打造一个持续不断记录的系统："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"主动管理预期"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"让记录的门槛变低，随手可记"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"培养习惯，不要设置过高的目标，设置一个不可能完不成的目标，重点是培养习惯"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"设置客观环境"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"逼自己一把，让自己不得不做"}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"笔记的方法","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:275","type":"doc","id":275}},{"label":"心法篇，以我为主，持续不断","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:301","type":"doc","id":301}},{"label":"持续不断","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:303","type":"doc","id":303}}],"prevPage":{"title":"以我为主","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:302","type":"doc","id":302}},"createTime":1743914628656,"updateTime":1743918530266,"projectId":23},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743918530266}}